{"metadata":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SuffixTree","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:16SuffixStructures0A4TreeV","remoteSource":{"fileName":"SuffixTree.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/GrafluentCollections\/blob\/main\/Sources\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree.swift#L29"},"title":"SuffixTree","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SuffixTree","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"SuffixStructures"}],"symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The suffix tree of one or more texts: the compressed trie of all their suffixes, built left to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"right in O("},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":") (Ukkonen, “On-Line Construction of Suffix Trees”, 1995)."}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/Occurrence","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/SuffixLinksView-swift.struct"],"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/init(_:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/init(texts:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/longestCommonSubstring","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/longestRepeatedSubstring","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/nodeCount","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/nodes","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/root","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/suffixLinksView-swift.property","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/textCount"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/children(of:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/contains(_:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/edgeLabel(of:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/isLeaf(_:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/occurrences(of:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/parent(of:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/pathLabel(of:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/stringDepth(of:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SuffixTree","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Symbol","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Symbol","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Every suffix of every text ends at a leaf, the empty suffix included, and every internal node","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is a point where suffixes that agree so far go different ways, so the tree has at most 2","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" + 1","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"nodes. A pattern is found in O(","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"m","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":") steps down from the root, and the leaves below where it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ends are its occurrences.","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let tree = SuffixTree(\"banana\")","tree.occurrences(of: \"ana\").map(\\.range)   \/\/ [3 ..< 6, 1 ..< 4]","tree.longestRepeatedSubstring?.range       \/\/ 3 ..< 6, \"ana\"","","let both = SuffixTree(texts: [\"xabxac\", \"abcabxabcd\"])","both.longestCommonSubstring                \/\/ text 1, 3 ..< 7: \"abxa\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Nodes are numbered in preorder from the root at 0, so a node’s subtree is the nodes from it to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"just before the next node that is not its descendant. Children come in the order of the symbol"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that starts their edge: sorted when "},{"code":"Symbol","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"code":"Comparable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", so the leaves are in the order of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"their suffixes and match a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixArray"},{"type":"text","text":" of the same text; otherwise in the order the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"symbols first occur in the texts. Each text ends in a terminator of its own that sorts before"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every symbol and belongs to no label."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tree converts to Grafluent’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RootedTree"},{"type":"text","text":" with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RootedTree(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", and its suffix links are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a directed graph, "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/suffixLinksView-swift.property"},{"type":"text","text":". Each node takes 32 bytes and each symbol 4 more, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"texts’ codes, which the tree keeps."}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/suffixstructures\/suffixtree"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://SuffixStructures/documentation/SuffixStructures/SuffixTree/suffixLinksView-swift.property":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"The tree’s suffix links as a directed graph: a vertex per node, and an edge from each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"internal node but the root to the node whose path label is its own without the first","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"symbol.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","conformance":{"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Symbol"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Hashable"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}]},"url":"\/documentation\/suffixstructures\/suffixtree\/suffixlinksview-swift.property","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/suffixLinksView-swift.property